<section class="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__title">What people are saying</h2>
    <div class="reviews__grid">
      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">The amazing talent shines through with this shop. The way she transforms her live art into super comfy clothing (many pieces being handmade) is something I&rsquo;ve never seen before. I always get compliments on the unique designs and it&rsquo;s mindblowing to know I&rsquo;m wearing a local artist&rsquo;s work. Highly recommend! 🪷🐉</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Akilah Anderson</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Local Guide &middot; Google Review</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">It&rsquo;s clear to me that Ever Fluorescent is run by a passionate and talented artist who pours herself into her artwork and business. Her designs are uniquely vibrant and soulful&hellip;and intentionally come alive in the dark! The paintings are actually 2-in-1 because of their UV light reactivity. She is also very kind and responsive to customers.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Melissa</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Google Review</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">Amazing art and artists!!! One of my favorite booths to visit when at festivals.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Neely Keene</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Google Review</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">Excellent clothing, creations, and art from Ever Fluorescent. I bought a piece from her back in 2018 and it&rsquo;s still holding up to this day (custom made backpack). Don&rsquo;t hesitate! She&rsquo;s worth buying from.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">trickell</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Google Review</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">I&rsquo;ve been shopping with them since 2020 and have loved seeing all the new items that have been made since then. Everything is very well made and beautiful and every detail is covered. Can&rsquo;t wait to see what&rsquo;s new this year!</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Amber G</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Local Guide &middot; Google Review</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">Ever Fluorescent has vended at some of my shows and she is always a great addition &mdash; a kind, smiling vendor that enjoys being there as much as we enjoy having her. Her products are always top notch and her setup always looks great. Highly recommend her products.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Lars Hilb</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; April 23, 2020</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">Super talented artist and reliable, energetic and professional vendor! Great business partner to have at events! This gal is super motivated and it shows in the quality of her products.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Emily Wehrman</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; April 23, 2020</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">Worked with and purchased from Ever Fluorescent many times! Amazing art, even more amazing person! Highly recommend!!</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Skyler LaRue Katner</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; April 23, 2020</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">I can&rsquo;t say enough about how great the masks we purchased are. They came so quick, great quality, and the designs made a fun memory out of a scary situation. The two child sized ones fit perfectly for both kiddos and I love that there&rsquo;s extra room to adjust them as they get bigger.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Jodi Buchwald</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; May 1, 2020</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">I bought some masks during the pandemic, and the shipping was fast, and the order was great. My friends love &rsquo;em, and I get a ton of compliments on my masks. If you gotta wear a mask, make sure it&rsquo;s one that makes you feel Ever Fluorescent.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Romarium Arty</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; July 9, 2020</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">Awesome quality, fast shipping, and excellent service!!!!</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Christine Kacos</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; April 30, 2020</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="review-card__text">I love the vibes and everything you stand for.</p>
        <footer class="review-card__author">
          <span class="review-card__name">Tony Kasmiski</span>
          <span class="review-card__meta">Facebook Review &middot; September 10, 2021</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
    <p class="reviews__cta">
      <%= link_to "See more on Google →", "https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ever+Fluorescent/@41.5523412,-88.2174476,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x4344efc5dcdb14b9:0x97a2ee0b8b0527cf!8m2!3d41.5523372!4d-88.2148727!9m1!1b1!16s%2Fg%2F11pzpsdhcz",
            target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>
      &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
      <%= link_to "See more on Facebook →", "https://www.facebook.com/StayFluorescent/reviews/",
            target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
